	"Actor-encyclopedia.reck.stlk-Name": "算计者多功能步战车（追猎者）",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.reck.stlk-Strengths": "· 强势对抗：轻甲单位、步兵",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.reck.stlk-Weaknesses": "· 弱势对抗：重甲单位、防御建筑\n· 无法攻击飞行器",
